:PATH
A. General rules
|

:INFO
Art. 1
1 Articles 1–4 of the Final Title of the Civil Code apply to the Amendment of 17 March 2017, unless the following provisions provide otherwise.2 The new law shall apply to existing legal entities on its coming into force.
|

:NOTE
SR 210

:PATH
B. Registration obligation for public institutions
|

:INFO
Art. 2
Public institutions established before the new law comes into force and which primarily carry on a private gainful economic activity must be entered in the commercial register within two years.

